WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.265 --> 00:00:03.325
You know, the most important thing in this job

00:00:03.785 --> 00:00:05.795
is knowing you can trust the guy next to you.

00:00:09.855 --> 00:00:11.185
No one does it alone.

00:00:14.585 --> 00:00:16.125
One of my men is missing.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:24.315
I think he is in a prison called "Hades".

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:32.020
What is this place?
- Land of the dead.

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:35.880
Everyone in this zoo has information worth millions of dollars.

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:38.560
Spies, criminals, businessmen...

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.060
We're all animals here.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:42.740
That's why they call it "The Zoo".

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:44.420
And I'm the zookeeper.

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.040
Welcome to "Hades".

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:53.740
What makes you think he's there?

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:57.000
His cousin Yusheng is putting on some kind of hitlist.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.180
Then we gotta go in, get him out.

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:01.140
I have this acquaintance, friend of mine...

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:03.920
Big guy...

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:07.280
I want in.
- Then we made a plan.

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:08.500
Sounds familiar.

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:10.180
Freeze!

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:13.520
I sure hope you know what you're doing.

00:01:14.035 --> 00:01:15.915
I like working from the inside out.

00:01:16.505 --> 00:01:17.505
Know layer...

00:01:19.435 --> 00:01:20.695
Know the routine...

00:01:22.815 --> 00:01:23.815
And you have help.

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:26.555
Get all in one and help get him out.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.600
This is bigger than any one of us.

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:33.620
Showtime.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:41.780
All the guys in "Hades"...

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:50.160
 

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:54.580
Time is up!

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:02.320
Hey, Breslin, good to be back?

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:03.880
No, it's bad to be back.

